OL,4,CKing Charles and Elton John pay        
OL,5,Ctribute to Australian music legend     
OL,6,CMolly Meldrum                          
OL,7,GKing Charles and Elton John have paid  
OL,8,Gtribute to Australian music industry   
OL,9,Glegend Molly Meldrum, who died aged 83 
OL,10,Gafter a long illness.                  
OL,12,FMeldrum's family said he "passed away  
OL,13,Fpeacefully" at a hospital in Melbourne 
OL,14,Fin the early hours of Monday morning.  
OL,16,FThe music promoter and broadcaster,    
OL,17,Fborn Ian Alexander Meldrum, helped     
OL,18,Fdefine the nation's music tastes for   
OL,19,Fdecades, championing local artists     
OL,20,Flike INXS and Kylie Minogue and global 
OL,21,Facts like Abba.                        
